\title{The merge under M is the visibility point}
\taxon{Card}
\tag{card}
\meta{anki}{1786316439211}

\prompt{What is a store's global visibility point, and what does that imply for [[VH8Y]]?}{
  The instant the data is \strong{merged into the L1D line while holding M}.

  Before that, the value lives only in the [[UNB6]] — forwardable to this core through [[GXCN]], invisible to every other. That asymmetry is exactly why TSO permits \strong{store#{\to}load reordering}.
}
